# Available Tools

## CLI Tools

| Tool | Command | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| Claude Code | `claude` | AI coding assistant with file editing |
| Codex CLI | `codex` | OpenAI coding assistant |
| GitHub CLI | `gh` | Repository management, PRs, issues |
| AWS CLI | `aws` | AWS service operations (scoped) |
| Docker | `docker` | Container build and management |
| uv | `uv` | Fast Python package management |
| Git | `git` | Version control |

## MCP Servers

### Playwright (Browser Automation)
- **Port**: 8931
- **Config**: `/opt/clawdult/tools/playwright/mcp-config.json`
- **Capabilities**: Navigate, click, type, screenshot, PDF generation

## Package Managers

- **npm** - Node.js packages (prefix: `~/.npm-global`)
- **pip/uv** - Python packages
- **cargo** - Rust packages
- **go install** - Go packages
- **brew** - Additional system tools (Linuxbrew)

## Environment Variables

Key environment variables are set in `/opt/clawdult/config/agent.env`:
- `CLAWDULT_INSTANCE=true`
- `CLAWDULT_WORKSPACE=/opt/clawdult/workspace`
- `CLAWDULT_AGENT_NAME` - This agent's name (set at boot)
